cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SynthoraAI (AI Government Content Curator) in your research, teaching, or other work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SynthoraAI: AI Government Content Curator"
abstract: >-
  SynthoraAI is an open-source, AI-assisted government and news article
  curation platform. It ingests articles via a scheduled crawler,
  generates concise summaries with AI, stores them in MongoDB, and
  exposes them through a TypeScript Express API and a Next.js frontend.
  Additional capabilities include passwordless passkey (WebAuthn /
  FIDO2) authentication, retrieval-augmented chat over the article
  corpus using Pinecone vector search, bias analysis, related article
  recommendations, comments and ratings, a Resend-powered newsletter
  pipeline, an MCP server, and a LangGraph agentic AI orchestration
  layer.
